<title>HONG KONG: S.China Strategic restructuring approved.</title>
<headline>S.China Strategic restructuring approved.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>South China Strategic Ltd said on Tuesday its shareholders had approved the company's reorganisation by way of scheme of arrangement.</p>
<p>On October 1, South China Strategic shares and warrants will be replaced by those of holding company South China Strategic Investments Ltd, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
